#: ../../source/api/tree/btree.rst:12 5073a4a5283449d588cdb08b0313f843
msgid ""
"This module provides a B-Tree implementation optimized for disk-based "
"storage systems. B-Trees maintain sorted data and allow searches, "
"insertions, and deletions in logarithmic time with a base determined by "
"the node capacity, minimizing disk I/O operations."
msgstr ""

